  m_Name: MarketDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MarketDatabase_SO
  setupNotes: 'Fill ItemID from the game''s master item database.

    Old data targets:
    10 seed IDs, 10 flower seed IDs, cattle meat IDs (cow/chicken/pig), egg ID, 20
    dish IDs.

    New data targets to add later to the master DB: fish sauce, salt,
    MSG, vegetables.

    Market only owns BuyPrice and Min/MaxQuantity for each
    ItemID.'
